Destroys one of your summons, making it detonate in radius of [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)].
*  Ritch Flamespitter: Explodes into a fireball dealing [152, 205, 246, 281, 311 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage, flameshocking damaged foes
*  Hydra: Grants [10%, 22%, 29%, 33%, 36% (TL1-5)] lightning, acid, and nature affinity as well as [22, 30, 36, 41, 46 (TL1-5; MP 100)] life regen per turn to all friendly creatures for 7 turns
*  Rimebark: Explodes into an iceball dealing [152, 205, 246, 281, 311 (TL1-5; MP 100)] ice damage, possibly freezing damaged foes
*  Fire Drake: Explodes into a cloud of lingering fire, dealing [71, 95, 114, 131, 145 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage per turn
*  War Hound: Explodes into a sharp ball, cutting all creatures for [52, 70, 84, 96, 107 (TL1-5; MP 100)] bleeding damage per turn for 6 turns
*  Jelly: Explodes into a ball of slowing slime, dealing [152, 205, 246, 281, 311 (TL1-5; MP 100)] nature damage and slowing foes by [21%, 32%, 38%, 42%, 45% (TL1-5)]
*  Minotaur: Confuses foes at [17%, 23%, 27%, 30%, 32% (TL1-5)] power for 5 turns
*  Stone Golem: Grants [15, 21, 25, 29, 33 (TL1-5)] armour and [22%, 30%, 38%, 45%, 53% (TL1-5)] armour hardiness to all friendly creatures for 5 turns
*  Turtle: Grants a small shell shield to all friendly creatures, granting [19%, 26%, 31%, 36%, 40% (TL1-5; MP 100)] all resist for 5 turns
*  Spider: Knocks back all foes [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] tiles

In addition, a random summon will come off cooldown.

Hostile effects will not hit you or your other summons.

The effects improve with your mindpower, and some can crit.
